    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Divination sphere (Blindfolded Oracle (sense)), War sphere.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you close your eyes to use Blindfolded Oracle while within the area of your totem, you may choose to have your blindsense extend to the entire area of the totem rather than close range. When used in this way, your blindsense stops at the edge of your totem’s area.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/divination#toc123\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
